{"seq":1,"slug":"tacit-composition","title":"隐式函数组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/apl-array-programming/idioms/tacit-composition","wordCount":1461,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"隐式函数组合\">隐式函数组合</h1><p><code>mean ← +/÷≢</code> —— 这一行没有提到任何参数，却定义了「平均值」函数。<code>+/</code> 是求和，<code>≢</code> 是计数，<code>÷</code> 是除，三个函数被并排拼成一个新函数，读起来就是「和 除以 个数」。这种不提参数、直接拼函数的风格叫隐式编程（tacit programming）或无点风格（point-free），是数组语言里最能体现 <a href=\"../foundations/why-array-programming\">为何数组编程</a> 中「记法即思维」的地方，也是从「能读」跨到「能写」的标志性技能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-隐式与显式的分界\">核心概念：隐式与显式的分界</h2><p>先看对比。同样是平均值，显式（explicit）写法要给参数命名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"apl\" data-code=\"mean ← {(+/⍵)÷≢⍵}     ⍝ 显式: ⍵ 是右参数, 出现两次&#10;mean ← +/÷≢            ⍝ 隐式: 不提参数, 函数直接拼接\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>mean ← {(+/⍵)÷≢⍵}     ⍝ 显式: ⍵ 是右参数, 出现两次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mean ← +/÷≢            ⍝ 隐式: 不提参数, 函数直接拼接</span></span></code></pre></div><p>显式写法里 <code>⍵</code>（右参数）出现了两次，读者要在脑中追踪「这个 ⍵ 和那个 ⍵ 是同一个输入」。隐式写法消除了这个名字，让表达式回归到「函数之间如何组合」的纯结构。隐式不是为了少打字，而是为了让代码的形态直接反映数据流的形态——参数名是噪音，函数的拼接结构才是信号。</p>\n<p>这和函数式编程里的 point-free 风格同源，但数组语言把它推得更远：它有专门的语法形态（火车）让多函数拼接无需任何组合算子。两者的异同，详见 <a href=\"#延伸阅读--跨库链接\">跨库链接</a> 指向的 point-free 一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合的基本积木-与\">组合的基本积木：∘ 与 ⍤</h2><p>最基础的隐式组合工具是 <a href=\"../core/operators-adverbs\">算子与副词</a> 里见过的二元算子 <code>∘</code>（compose / beside）。<code>f∘g</code> 构造一个新函数，对输入先施 <code>g</code> 再施 <code>f</code>，对应数学上的复合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f \\circ g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(f \\circ g)(x) = f(g(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如 <code>(-∘1)</code> 是「减一」，<code>(÷∘2)</code> 是「除以二」，<code>(×∘2)∘(+∘1)</code> 是「先加一再乘二」。<code>∘</code> 把两个函数粘成一个，是隐式编程的原子操作。配合 <a href=\"../core/rank-broadcasting\">秩与广播</a> 的 rank 算子 <code>⍤</code>，你还能控制组合在哪一层子数组上发生。但仅靠 <code>∘</code> 串联，表达「和除以个数」这种「同一输入喂给两条支路再汇合」的结构会很笨拙——这正是火车要解决的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"火车-fork-与-hook\">火车：fork 与 hook</h2><p>数组语言的杀手锏是<strong>火车</strong>（train）：把多个函数并排写在一起，语言按位置自动赋予它们组合语义，完全不用 <code>∘</code>。最重要的两种是叉子（fork）和钩子（hook）。</p>\n<p><strong>叉子（fork）</strong> 是三个函数并排 <code>(f g h)</code>，对输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的语义是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(f\\ g\\ h)(x) = (f(x))\\ g\\ (h(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即「左右两支 <code>f</code> 和 <code>h</code> 各自处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，再用中间的 <code>g</code> 把两个结果合并」。<code>mean ← +/÷≢</code> 正是一个叉子：左支 <code>+/</code>（求和）、右支 <code>≢</code>（计数）、中间 <code>÷</code>（相除）。输入向量同时流入求和与计数两条支路，再相除。这种「分流—汇合」结构在通用语言里要写临时变量，在火车里是一行。</p>\n<p><strong>钩子（hook）</strong> 是两个函数并排 <code>(f g)</code>，语义是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(f\\ g)(x) = x\\ f\\ (g(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即「右函数处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 后，把结果与原始 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 再用左函数结合」。例如 <code>(× ÷)</code> 之类可表达「与自己的某个变换比较」的模式；常见的 <code>(⊢,⊢)</code> 风格用于把变换结果接回原值。钩子捕捉的是「一个值与它自身的某个函数」这种递归式依赖。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复合 compose</td>\n<td><code>f∘g</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(g(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>串联两个变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钩子 hook</td>\n<td><code>f g</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ f\\ g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>值与自身变换结合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叉子 fork</td>\n<td><code>f g h</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)\\ g\\ h(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>分流两支再汇合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长火车</td>\n<td><code>a b c d e</code></td>\n<td>递归拆成 fork</td>\n<td>链式分流组合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>更长的火车（4、5 个函数）会按固定规则递归拆成嵌套的 fork 与 hook，让任意复杂的分流—汇合结构都能无名表达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据流视角-火车就是-dag\">数据流视角：火车就是 DAG</h2><p>理解火车最好的方式是把它看成数据流图。输入从右端进入，沿多条支路流动、变换，在中间节点汇合，最终从顶端输出一个结果。下图画出叉子 <code>+/÷≢</code>（平均值）的数据流：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;输入向量 x&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;右支 ≢&lt;br/&gt;计数 → n&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;左支 +/&lt;br/&gt;求和 → s&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;中间 ÷&lt;br/&gt;s ÷ n&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;输出: 平均值&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"输入向量 x\"] --&gt; B[\"右支 ≢&lt;br/&gt;计数 → n\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"左支 +/&lt;br/&gt;求和 → s\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"中间 ÷&lt;br/&gt;s ÷ n\"]\n    B --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[\"输出: 平均值\"]</pre><p><code>x</code> 同时流向计数与求和两条支路，结果在 <code>÷</code> 节点汇合。火车的妙处在于：这张数据流图与源代码 <code>+/÷≢</code> 的字符顺序几乎一一对应——代码的形态就是数据流的形态。这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/why-array-programming\">为何数组编程</a> 主张的「记法直接承载意图」在组合层面的兑现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时该用-何时别用\">何时该用、何时别用</h2><p>隐式编程不是越多越好。它在「数据流简单、支路清晰」时极其优雅——平均值、规范化、单趟变换链。但当逻辑需要中间命名才能讲清、或者分支条件复杂时，强行写成火车会变成「只写不读」的密码。成熟的判断是：如果给某个中间结果起个名字能让读者更快理解，就用显式 <code>{...⍵...}</code>；如果命名只是徒增噪音、函数拼接已经一目了然，就用隐式。</p>\n<p>这条「隐式 vs 显式」的取舍，和 <a href=\"../practice/array-when-to-use\">选型与边界</a> 里「数组语言 vs 通用语言」的取舍是同构的：抽象的密度有甜区，过犹不及。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>隐式编程（tacit / point-free）不给参数命名，直接拼接函数，让代码形态反映数据流形态；<code>+/÷≢</code> 即「和除以个数」。</li>\n<li><code>∘</code> 是组合的原子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f \\circ g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 先 g 后 f），<code>⍤</code> 控制组合作用的子数组秩。</li>\n<li>火车是数组语言的杀手锏：叉子 <code>(f g h)</code> 做「两支分流—中间汇合」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)\\ g\\ h(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，钩子 <code>(f g)</code> 做「值与自身变换」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ f\\ g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；长火车递归拆成 fork/hook。</li>\n<li>把火车看成数据流 DAG，源代码字符顺序与数据流图几乎一一对应。</li>\n<li>隐式有甜区：数据流简单时优雅，逻辑复杂或需中间命名时改用显式更可读。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../core/operators-adverbs\">算子与副词</a> —— <code>∘</code> 与火车所依赖的算子机制；<a href=\"scan-reduce-idioms\">扫描与归约惯用法</a> —— 火车里常作支路的 <code>/</code> <code>\\</code>。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/why-array-programming\">为何数组编程</a> —— 隐式组合是「记法即思维」的极致；<a href=\"../practice/array-when-to-use\">选型与边界</a> —— 抽象密度的取舍。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../functional-programming/composition-patterns/point-free-style\">无点风格</a> —— 同一思想在通用函数式语言中的形态与边界。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../functional-programming/composition-patterns/function-composition\">函数组合</a> —— <code>∘</code> 组合的理论基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"隐式函数组合","id":"隐式函数组合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：隐式与显式的分界","id":"核心概念-隐式与显式的分界"},{"level":2,"text":"组合的基本积木：∘ 与 ⍤","id":"组合的基本积木-与"},{"level":2,"text":"火车：fork 与 hook","id":"火车-fork-与-hook"},{"level":2,"text":"数据流视角：火车就是 DAG","id":"数据流视角-火车就是-dag"},{"level":2,"text":"何时该用、何时别用","id":"何时该用-何时别用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"秩与广播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/apl-array-programming/core/rank-broadcasting"},"next":{"title":"扫描与归约惯用法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/apl-array-programming/idioms/scan-reduce-idioms"}}